WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.410
Far from any planet, a
crate drifts in deep space.

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.700
Yet push it, and it is
still hard to speed up.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.420
Inertia does not need gravity.

4
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:14.630
Back on the ground, drop a hammer
and a feather where there is no air.

5
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.760
They fall side by side, and land together.

6
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:20.130
One is far heavier than the other.

7
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.460
Why should they keep perfect pace?

8
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:27.000
In this mission, you'll meet two
quite different jobs that mass does.

9
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.250
Then you'll step into a
closed room with no windows,

10
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.640
and try to tell whether you're
on Earth or in a rocket.

11
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:38.030
Your mission: explain why the hammer
and the feather hit the ground together.
